        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In this hilarious and innovative strategy role-playing game, players take control of Finn Courtland and his band of misfits in their quest for fame and riches. Along the way, they just might have to save the world from the evil Arbitus and his band of demons. It'll take brains as well as brawn to win the day, though; the grid-based combat challenges players to think strategically and make the best use of each character's unique skills and abilities. The strategy doesn't end there, though! Players can spend their hard-earned cash to set up the game's\nrandomized dungeons to their liking; choose the terrain, the size of the dungeon, and the monsters that you'll face. Play it safe, or take on bigger risks for even greater rewards! Your adventure is in your hands!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "En este divertido e innovador juego de rol y estrategia, los jugadores toman el control de Finn Courtland y su banda de inadaptados en busca de fama y riqueza. Por el camino, quizá tengan que salvar al mundo del malvado Arbitus y su banda de demonios. Hará falta cerebro tanto como músculo para ganar el día: el combate por cuadrícula obliga a pensar estratégicamente y a aprovechar las habilidades y capacidades únicas de cada personaje. ¡Y la estrategia no termina ahí! Los jugadores pueden gastar el dinero que tanto les costó ganar para configurar las mazmorras aleatorias a su gusto: elige el terreno, el tamaño de la mazmorra y los monstruos a los que te enfrentarás. ¡Juega sobre seguro o arriésgate a retos mayores para obtener recompensas aún mayores! Tu aventura está en tus manos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2008",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
